PROVENANCE NOTE
The `clause` and `source_url` fields quote or reference official Government of
India scheme text (primarily myscheme.gov.in and linked circulars). That
underlying government text is a public work and is not itself owned by the
Adhikaar contributors; the CC BY 4.0 license here covers the *encoding,
structuring, labeling, and curation* of that material into this dataset. Users
relying on eligibility outcomes should verify against the cited official source.
